sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant MCP as MCP Tool
    participant External as External Service

    User->>Agent: Request Investigation (Target IP)
    Agent->>Agent: Validate Input and Select SOP
    Agent->>MCP: Call mcp__asn-lookup__lookup_ip
    MCP->>External: Query Local / Remote Database
    External-->>MCP: Return ASN and Geo Info
    MCP-->>Agent: Formatted Result
    Agent->>Agent: Correlate & Assess Risk
    Agent-->>User: Present Attribution Report
